	),
	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A competent adult says, “Risk discussions make me anxious. Tell me only the benefits.” The proposed intervention carries a foreseeable risk that could reasonably influence the decision. What should the therapist do?',
		'option_a'       => 'Omit the risk because a competent client may require the therapist to conceal material information.',
