	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A therapist proposes a new intervention to a competent adult in voluntary treatment. The therapist guarantees success, omits a foreseeable client-specific risk, conceals a reasonable alternative requiring referral, introduces a substantial new fee, uses technical language the client does not understand, and immediately asks for a signature. What is the best corrective response?',
