		'option_d'       => 'Ongoing informed consent applies only to telehealth.',
		'correct_option' => 'b',
		'explanation'    => 'A. Incorrect. Ongoing consent does not require mechanical repetition of the entire intake process at every appointment.
		B. Correct. The therapist should respond to significant changes, new information, questions, misunderstanding, and meaningful decision points.
		C. Incorrect. A signature documents an earlier decision but does not eliminate later questions or material changes.
