	),
	array(
		'question_text'  => 'After treatment begins, the therapist learns of a foreseeable client-specific risk that was not previously known and could influence whether the client continues an intervention. What should the therapist do?',
		'option_a'       => 'Withhold the information because treatment has already started.',
		'option_b'       => 'Document the risk but discuss it only if harm occurs.',
