	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A 15-year-old independently consented to outpatient therapy. The parent presents a document signed by the minor stating: “My therapist may disclose anything about me to my parent forever.” The document does not identify the information to be disclosed, its permitted use, or an expiration date. What should the therapist do?',
